<title>ESTONIA: INTERBANK LOAN RATE MAINTAIN FALL.</title>
<headline>INTERBANK LOAN RATE MAINTAIN FALL.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average interbank loan rate</p>
<p>fell across all maturities during the latest week, the central</p>
<p>bank said.</p>
<p>One money market dealer said rates continued to fall due to</p>
<p>a further increase of funds available on the interbank market.</p>
<p>&quot;The same thing happened last week with an increase of funds</p>
<p>on offer on all rates,&quot; she said.</p>
<p> TALIBOR/TALIBID    1Week	1Month     3Months</p>
<p>   June 18	    4.13/3.13  5.45/4.45  7.00/6.00</p>
<p>   June 11	    4.17/3.17  5.47/4.47  7.35/6.35</p>
